    <briefdescription>
<para>Displays a call-graph. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><image type="html" name="CallGraphWidget.jpg"></image>
</para><para>Displays a callgraph associated with a project, and layouts it with a spring embedder algorithm uses the <ref refid="classProjectManager" kindref="compound">ProjectManager</ref> to build up a callgraph </para>    </detaileddescription>
